url: "https://github.com/OrhunTokdemir/anonymized-tweet-scraper"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OrhunTokdemir/anonymized-tweet-scraper"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A terminal application that collects public posts from Twitter/X and
  Ekşi Sözlük, pseudonymizes them (removing usernames, mentions, profile
  links, e-mail addresses and phone numbers), and writes them to CSV for
  research. It includes a batch mode that builds Turkish offensive-language
  datasets from a seed lexicon, with weakly labeled offensive candidates and
  control posts.
